  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Initial Cleanup internals",
      "items": [
        "Edge Cleanup: hash exact edges, match nearby edges and snap vertices; up to 3 passes from main.py.",
        "Patch + Normals: remove disconnected facets, fill holes, orient faces, recompute normals and correct negative volume. Stage output is a temporary STL."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Advanced Repair internals",
      "items": [
        "Analyzer loads STL, deduplicates vertices and measures defects. Routines group shell union/culling, degenerates, non-manifold separation, winding, M\u00f6bius cracking, welding and hole patches.",
        "The pipeline coordinates up to 3 refinement passes with structural rollback; final audit and float32 stabilization precede export/reload checks. Completion can leave defects."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust, settings & optional paths",
      "items": [
        "INI / --adaptive sets tolerances. NumPy, numpy-stl and SciPy run with process privileges; optional trimesh Boolean union uses available backends. Trust boundaries are not sandboxes.",
        "Optional evaluators obtain Thingi10K over HTTPS or local files; local batch launches main.py with a 120 s default timeout + CSV. Evidence: current working tree; see analysis note for alternate paths."
      ]
    }
  ]
